    <!--
      A simple location-pin silhouette for the status bar. Android renders a notification's small
      icon from its alpha channel alone (everything else is ignored and re-tinted by the system),
      so this is deliberately a plain filled shape rather than the full-color launcher icon
      (mipmap/ic_launcher) — that one is an adaptive-icon XML built from two layered, colorful
      drawables, which is the wrong shape for a status-bar icon regardless of tint.
